<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Era of She-Ra</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Cast out the shadows. Bring the universe to Prime's light.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Cast out the shadows. Bring the universe to Prime's light.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;"The Heart of Etheriaâ€¦"&lt;br /&gt;"...I'm sorryâ€¦"&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;"Adora! Adora!!"&lt;br /&gt;"Don't you get it?! I love you! I always have! So please, just this once, stay!" She cried, burying her face in the crook of her shoulder, "Stayâ€¦"&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;"You love me..?" The blonde gasped, looking up at the magicat with wide eyes that forced a laugh out of her.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;"You're such an idiot." She mused, only for her own eyes to widen at the fond expression of pure love Adora was giving her.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;"I love you tooâ€¦"&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;That was enough. Catra smiled warmly, cupping Adora's face as she leaned in, their lips crashing together in a fiery passion as the Failsafe finally fully activated, surrounding the couple with magic as it blasted it's way out of the Heart and back to Etheria where it belonged. And for a moment, everything was perfect. Catra loved Adora, and Adora loved Catra. They were finally sharing their long overdue first kiss as Etheria was returned to the magical being it should have always been, taking Prime out and ending the war that should have never been.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Then that moment ended.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
